d="Narr_oHzgxoXUoUOZvoQ-WhtHZQ">525</ix:nonFraction> thousand, which commenced September 30, 2024, with the remaining outstanding principal amount of &#8364;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_EUR_Np8_fFq8_kObu1zLYIauwg" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_TermLoan2028BFacilityMember_qaNjrInxzUGYGgmkQBy9_w" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentPeriodicPaymentTermsBalloonPaymentToBePaid" scale="6" id="Narr_bT1ob2pUyEiSJdear-y_NA">2.6</ix:nonFraction> million payable at maturity along with accrued and unpaid interest. The Company may, at any time, prepay the principal of the Senior Credit Facilities. Each prepayment shall be accompanied by the payment of accrued interest, without any premium or penalty. However, the Company is limited to a maximum of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_item_yxjeQwb1V0mVbt3tcuH4WA" contextRef="Duration_6_1_2024_To_6_30_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_us-gaap_RevolvingCreditFacilityMember_LBW64XFAFkqBwJBEa9dBxw" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="xbp:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumNumberOfVoluntaryPrepaymentsPerAnnum" scale="0" id="Narr_od_2tZwcHk6nR59Zqjd-Ag">four</ix:nonFraction> voluntary prepayments of the Revolving Credit Facility within any consecutive twelve-month period. During the three and six months ended June 30, 2026 (Successor), the Company repaid $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bmzRMS-W4keOx5FozpRA5w" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_TermLoan2028FacilitiesMaturingJune262028Member_-sjV_KAm_E6QBXKR4m3cUQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RepaymentsOfLongTermLinesOfCredit" scale="6" id="Narr_T1gT_9KAREamsgbSxMsX6w">0.8</ix:nonFraction> million and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bmzRMS-W4keOx5FozpRA5w" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_TermLoan2028FacilitiesMaturingJune262028Member_30GCBvSKzUS1lGyupRaGBg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RepaymentsOfLongTermLinesOfCredit" scale="6" id="Narr_mQD2eG37qU-DMSmqgJASsQ">1.6</ix:nonFraction> million, respectively, of outstanding principal amounts under the 2028 Term Loan A Facility and 2028 Term Loan B Facility. As of June 30, 2026 (Successor), the outstanding balance of the 2028 Term Loan A Facility, the 2028 Term Loan B Facility, and the Revolving Credit Facility was approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bmzRMS-W4keOx5FozpRA5w" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_TermLoan2028FacilityMember_RYsAK3gNg0KkhgIZRQkVTg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LongTermDebt" scale="6" id="Narr_nsVa5OAYoEqFHavV9yn4MA">2.4</ix:nonFraction> million, $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bmzRMS-W4keOx5FozpRA5w" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_TermLoan2028BFacilityMember_U60HMmemLE2fRIHGOiDumg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LongTermDebt" scale="6" id="Narr_bJjBJQY3Yk-L-Pj9jubSnw">7.2</ix:nonFraction> million, and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bmzRMS-W4keOx5FozpRA5w" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_us-gaap_RevolvingCreditFacilityMember_EbzJ0hle_UGGaDwJuu8p7g" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LongTermDebt" scale="6" id="Narr_XZyMJTqER0GCPNb1a9z6wA">34.6</ix:nonFraction> million, respectively.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;padding-bottom:12pt;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;">The Facilities Agreement contains certain affirmative and negative covenants limiting the ability of XBP Europe, Inc. to effect mergers and change of control events as well as certain other limitations, including limitations on (i) incurrence of additional indebtedness or liens, (ii) dispositions of assets, (iii) substantial changes of the general nature of the business, (iv) entering into restrictive agreements, (v) making certain investments, loans, advances, guarantees and acquisitions, (vi) prepaying certain indebtedness, (vii) the declaration and payment of dividends or other restricted payments, (viii) engaging in transactions with affiliates, or (ix) amending certain material documents. The Facilities Agreement also contains financial covenants including, but not limited to: (i) a consolidated total leverage ratio of not greater than <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_ccSbwxZ2eE-Iz8EXGy6S7Q" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_FacilitiesAgreement2024Member__SDNxsMaWUecYKCGTR-9ew" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RatioOfIndebtednessToNetCapital1" scale="0" id="Narr_h_4vVjun-kmzB9ciaRp9_Q">2.50</ix:nonFraction> to 1.00 (with step-downs to (a) <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_ccSbwxZ2eE-Iz8EXGy6S7Q" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_FacilitiesAgreement2024Member__SDNxsMaWUecYKCGTR-9ew" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xbp:RatioOfIndebtednessToNetCapitalStartingFromJanuary2025" scale="0" id="Narr_KD40BB9tdkSeV8_qh9zOiA">2.25</ix:nonFraction> to 1.00 starting January 1, 2025 and (b) <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_ccSbwxZ2eE-Iz8EXGy6S7Q" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_FacilitiesAgreement2024Member__SDNxsMaWUecYKCGTR-9ew" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xbp:RatioOfIndebtednessToNetCapitalStartingFromJanuary2026" scale="0" id="Narr_nN_X7LkoLU-1ivdYdew1lQ">2.00</ix:nonFraction> to 1.00 starting January 1, 2026); (ii) a cash flow coverage ratio of at least <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_ccSbwxZ2eE-Iz8EXGy6S7Q" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_FacilitiesAgreement2024Member__SDNxsMaWUecYKCGTR-9ew" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xbp:CashFlowCoverageRatio" scale="0" id="Narr_WbSFR2wbzUeDtGiPt65FfQ">1.10</ix:nonFraction>:1.00; and (iii) a consolidated interest coverage ratio of not less than <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_ccSbwxZ2eE-Iz8EXGy6S7Q" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2024_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_FacilitiesAgreement2024Member_GoUDpa3VYkGIzOm7E73R3g" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="xbp:InterestCoverageRatio" scale="0" id="Narr_dPzyFuTzGUGPsJEuQCfS4Q">4.00</ix:nonFraction> to 1.00. As of June 30, 2026, the Company was in compliance with all affirmative and negative covenants under its Facilities Agreement, including all financial covenants, except for the consolidated total leverage ratio covenant and the consolidated interest coverage ratio covenant. The lender has acknowledged this matter, and no remedies were exercised or are expected to be exercised.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">BR Exar AR Facility</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;">On February 12, 2024, certain of the Company&#8217;s subsidiaries entered into a receivables purchase agreement with BR Exar, LLC (&#8220;BREL&#8221;), an affiliate of B. Riley Commercial Capital, LLC (as subsequently amended on various dates in connection with each monthly sale of certain existing receivables, up to and including December 31, 2025 (the &#8220;BR Exar AR Facility&#8221;)). The Company received an aggregate of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_bmzRMS-W4keOx5FozpRA5w" contextRef="Duration_8_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_xbp_BrExarArFacilityMember_XccY0BaKOkGQTUssCxX_Cg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfLongTermDebt" scale="6" id="Narr_oUDo3p8EwUqf1taakh0XEQ">15.2</ix:nonFraction> million and $<ix:nonFraction unitR